 ## Background
-Semantic rendering is a specialized form of volume rendering tailored for categorical data. It builds on [Semantic and Label-Based Classification](10722-semantic-and-label-based-classification.md) principles. The probabilistic aggregation variant was introduced in SDFStudio [S1, unofficial]. The Semantic-aware Weight Network variant was introduced in "Semantic Ray: Learning a Generalizable Semantic Field with Cross-Reprojection Attention" [S2].
+Semantic rendering is a specialized form of volume rendering tailored for categorical data. It builds on [Semantic and Label-Based Classification](10722-semantic-and-label-based-classification.md) principles. The probabilistic aggregation variant was introduced in SDFStudio [S2, unofficial]. The Semantic-aware Weight Network variant was introduced in "Semantic Ray: Learning a Generalizable Semantic Field with Cross-Reprojection Attention" [S3].
 
